:"2040–2046 Outlook"},{"type":"p","text":"Museum professionals may increasingly work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted collection cataloguing"},{"text":"3D digital collections"},{"text":"Virtual museums"},{"text":"Immersive exhibitions"},{"text":"AR historical reconstruction"},{"text":"AI visitor guides"},{"text":"Digital twins of heritage sites"},{"text":"Automated metadata generation"},{"text":"Global digital collection networks"},{"text":"Predictive visitor analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The curator is likely to evolve from primarily managing physical exhibitions toward being a researcher, cultural interpreter and digital collection strategist."},{"type":"h","text":"Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"History"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Indian history"},{"text":"World history"},{"text":"Art history"},{"text":"Cultural history"},{"text":"Historical methodology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Museum"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Museology"},{"text":"Collection management"},{"text":"Accessioning"},{"text":"Cataloguing"},{"text":"Provenance"},{"text":"Exhibition development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Archival research"},{"text":"Textual research"},{"text":"Object research"},{"text":"Academic writing"},{"text":"Historical interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collection databases"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Digital archiving"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Digital humanities"},{"text":"3D digitisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Exhibition budgeting"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"},{"text":"Public engagement"},{"text":"Museum administration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI cataloguing"},{"text":"AR/VR"},{"text":"Virtual museums"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"3D heritage"},{"text":"AI-assisted historical research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target P